{"asset_key":"timeline/dialoguetree_story_10241230","episode":"timeline","category":"dialoguetree_story","story_id":"10241230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1024123001:0":{"text":"이건... 골드예요!","source_cn":"这些……全是金币！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD2CB4A04EF255FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1024123002:0":{"text":"어라, 이 사슴 가죽 주머니에 미스릴 상회의 마크가 찍혀 있어요...","source_cn":"咦，这个鹿皮钱袋上有我们秘银商会的标志……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFB007A44D641A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1024123002":{"text":"어라, 이 사슴 가죽 주머니에 미스릴 상회의 마크가 찍혀 있어요...","source_cn":"咦，这个鹿皮钱袋上有我们秘银商会的标志……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFB007A44D641A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1024123003:0":{"text":"설마 이 도둑들이 앙펠드의 돈주머니를 훔쳐간 걸까요?","source_cn":"所以是这些盗匪偷走了恩菲尔德的钱袋？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E28E21D61DE9F79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1024123004:0":{"text":"이렇게 많은 걸 보니 도둑질을 한 지 한참 지난 것 같네요. 기사단에 알려 주인을 찾아줘야겠습니다.","source_cn":"这么多财物，看来这伙盗匪四处下手有一段时间了。我会上报...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A99501FA22895B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1024123005:0":{"text":"블레다크, 잘했어. 기사단에 들어오기 손색이 없는 수사력인데?","source_cn":"不错啊，小家伙！你的侦查能力足以加入骑士团了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFCACECB09999C1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1024123006:0":{"text":"꽥꽥꽥.","source_cn":"呱呱呱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A9E7F15322E51DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1024123006":{"text":"꽥꽥꽥.","source_cn":"呱呱呱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A9E7F15322E51DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1024123007:0":{"text":"꽤액.","source_cn":"呱唔。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3D8266B1814C4469","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"꽤액.","female":"꽤액.","variant_male_record_index":"95199","variant_female_record_index":"95200","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1024123008:0":{"text":"그럼 마을에서 한 행동이나 헛간을 기웃거렸던 일, 거위를 풀어줬던 것도 전부다...?","source_cn":"那它在镇里的那些举动，谷仓徘徊，还有放走别人的白鹅，又...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7FB48255ADE6A4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1024123009:0":{"text":"블